Shape TUBE WaferCutDisk2_QQQQ
WaferCutDisk2_QQQQ.Parameters 0.0 IngotRadius 0.00025

Shape Intersection AlDead2_QQQQ
AlDead2_QQQQ.Parameters stripsAl2 WaferCutDisk2

# Al dead layer on the bottom
